
<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_12-610_to_12-629">Secs. 12-610 to 12-629. Unincorporated business tax.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_228.htm#sec_12-610">12-610</a> to <a href ="chap_228.htm#sec_12-629">12-629</a>, inclusive, are repealed, effective with respect to income years of unincorporated businesses commencing on or after January 1, 1983.</p>
<p class="source-first">(P.A. 81-255, S. 2&#x2013;21, 37; P.A. 81-411, S. 7; Nov. Sp. Sess. P.A. 81-4, S. 31, 32; Nov. Sp. Sess. P.A. 81-12, S. 1&#x2013;5; P.A. 82-325, S. 3, 7; 82-400, S. 2, 3.)</p>
